Let's expand the powers for $
\left(\blueD{z^2}\right)^{\greenD{n}}=\purpleD{z^{10}}$.

$\begin{align}
\left(\blueD{z^2}\right)^{\greenD{n}}&=\underbrace{\blueD{z^2\cdot z^2 \cdot z^2  \cdot z^2  \cdot z^2}}_\greenD{n\text{ times}}
\\\\\\
&=\underbrace{
\underbrace{\blueD{z\cdot z}}_\text{2 times}
\cdot \underbrace{\blueD{z\cdot z}}_\text{2 times}
 \cdot \underbrace{\blueD{z\cdot z}}_\text{2 times}
 \cdot \underbrace{\blueD{z\cdot z}}_\text{2 times}
 \cdot \underbrace{\blueD{z\cdot z}}_\text{2 times}}
_\greenD{n\text{ times}}
\\\\
&=\purpleD{\underbrace{z\cdot z\cdot z\cdot z\cdot  z\cdot  z \cdot  z \cdot  z \cdot  z \cdot  z}_\text{10 times}}
\\\\
\end{align}$
